      "rationale": "Base equation defining the mathematical addSummary recurrence on an empty sequence.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-e795bdcd4cf6a717be57205d94fd92e497d330c8c9e2f3f5d219ac6d710923dd",
      "start_line": 56,
      "text": "  rule addSummary(.ValSeq, _:Bool) => 0"
