      "rationale": "Recurrence defining addSummary at an even index by skipping the head and toggling parity.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-053921866c6fc8a690d34dbd87e8da12e2465928cbe8aa21ac3acaf9f4c07d70",
      "start_line": 57,
      "text": "  rule addSummary(vCons(_:Val, VS:ValSeq), false)\n    => addSummary(VS, true)"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
