      "normalized_sha256": "985dc1e954078e0ea5cc62993d27a9a4aa79ce82ef913c38235280ff7e03f842",
      "rationale": "Recurrence defining addSummary at an odd index by conditionally adding an even head and recursing with toggled parity.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-985dc1e954078e0ea5cc62993d27a9a4aa79ce82ef913c38235280ff7e03f842",
      "start_line": 59,
      "text": "  rule addSummary(vCons(V:Val, VS:ValSeq), true)\n    => (#if pyMod(projectIntTotal(V), 2) ==Int 0\n        #then projectIntTotal(V)\n        #else 0\n        #fi)\n       +Int addSummary(VS, false)"
    }
